.Dd September 7, 2026
.Dt TERMINFO 5
.Os FreeLinX
.Sh NAME
.Nm terminfo
.Nd terminal capability database
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Pa /usr/share/misc/terminfo.cdb
is a NetBSD Constant Database holding the terminal capabilities used
by
.Xr tput 1 ,
.Xr tset 1 ,
and
.Xr ul 1 .
.Pp
Each record describes one terminal type, keyed by the terminal name
used in the
.Ev TERM
environment variable, and contains boolean, numeric, and string
capabilities describing the terminal's behaviour, such as cursor
movement, line clearing, and tab stops.
.Pp
The database is generated from terminfo source using
.Xr tic 1
with the
.Fl x
option.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr tput 1 ,
.Xr tset 1 ,
.Xr infocmp 1 ,
.Xr tabs 1 ,
.Xr tic 1
.Sh HISTORY
The terminfo database format first appeared in UNIX System V.